+    *   `expected_uid`, `expected_version`: Optional guards against `metadata.uid` and `metadata.version`. The lifecycle lease protects their check, including an already-running actor. A mismatch returns `FAILED_PRECONDITION`. Refresh the actor after a lifecycle operation before issuing another guarded request.
